  {
    "id": "anno-hikone_lower_p098_right-05",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "正租　米八萬三千二拾六石四升二合六勺四才二毛"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "せいそ　こめ はちまんさんぜんにじゅうろくこく よんしょう にごう ろくしゃく よんさい にもう（83,026.042642石）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Regular land tax (seiso), rice: 83,026.042642 koku. (MASTER's 83,216 was a misread — the figure is 三千二拾六 = 3,026, not 3,216.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正租米"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
