      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "ぜに きゅうせんさんびゃくじゅうきゅうかん きゅうじゅうななもん ごぶ（9,319.0975貫）ないわけ しょうんじょうぜい"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous taxes in copper-cash: 9,319.0975 kan (subscript: of which 7,937 kan 6…48 mon 7 bu are various transit/commercial levies, shoun-jō-zei). (MASTER's 9,322.97045 was a misread — the figure is 九千三百十九 = 9,319.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "雜税錢"
