  {
    "id": "anno-hikone_lower_p098_right-17",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "改メニヨレハ六升五合八勺チ除ク"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "あらためによれば ろくしょう ごごう はっしゃく を のぞく"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Two-column warichu (double-column interlinear note) attached to the 合計米 rice grand total: 'By the [re-]survey/revision, 6 shō 5 gō 8 shaku (0.0658 koku) is to be deducted.' Confirmed against the total: 合計米 = 93,588.8658 koku, whose sub-koku fraction 六升五合八勺 (=0.0658) is exactly the deducted amount, and 正租米 83,026.042642 + 雜税米 10,562.823156 = 93,588.8658, so the note documents the survey adjustment behind the rice total. Not a standalone data value."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "合計米割書改メニヨレハ六升五合八勺チ除ク"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
